*.md
# Proof harnesses and their output (Phase 1 item 9). These drive a browser from
# a laptop; nothing in the container ever runs them, and their output once
# reached 186 MB of screenshots and video frames being uploaded as build
# context on every deploy.
tools
gauntlet-*
billing-*
proof-*
title-proof*
repro-*
reviewer-*
verify-*
reconcile-probe
playwright-report
test-results
.playwright-mcp
.claude

# P38 — the deploy died before the build: "archive/tar: unknown file mode
# ?rwxr-xr-x". docs/history/_pw-profile/ is a saved Chromium profile whose
# Singleton{Lock,Cookie,Socket} are WSL symlinks (reparse tag 0xA000001D),
# which Windows tar cannot read. `*.md` above is anchored to the root, so the
# whole 127 MB docs/ tree was being uploaded on every deploy. Nothing in the
# image reads any of these: no runtime file reads outside app/, prisma/ and
# scripts/, and the build (vite / react-router) does not reference them.
docs
listing-assets
_to_delete
Claude outputs
navaal-e2e
drill.json
